course: dictionary
lesson: 2920
title: One word, many meanings
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: Some words have more than one meaning. The word drake usually means a male duck, but it can also be a name. The words around it show you which meaning is right.
explain: «In summer ducks moult all their flight feathers at once and cannot fly for a few weeks, drakes turn brown like females to hide.» The words ducks and females are clues. A drake is the male, so it must mean a male duck.
explain: «The wide Drake Passage... is one of the roughest seas on Earth.» Here Drake has a capital letter and sits next to passage and sea. Those clues show it is a name for a place, not a duck.
fact: A drake is a male duck. The female is brown so she can hide on her nest.
fact: Drake with a capital letter is a name. Sir Francis Drake was an English sea captain and explorer of the 1500s.
fact: «The Drake Passage» is a wide stretch of sea, about 800 km across, between Cape Horn and Antarctica.
fact: Drake is also the stage name of a Canadian rapper, and an old word for a dragon in some stories.
exercise: «In summer ducks moult their feathers, and drakes turn brown like females to hide.» In this sentence, what is a drake? | A dragon in an old story | *A male duck | A female duck | A kind of sea
exercise: Sir Francis Drake was an English sea captain and explorer of the 1500s. What kind of word is Drake here? | A bird's nest | *A name | A stormy wind | A male duck
exercise: «The wide Drake Passage is one of the roughest seas on Earth.» What is the Drake Passage? | A small island | A type of rain | A duck pond | *A wide, rough stretch of sea
test: In science, «the drake mallard has a shiny green head and a curly tail feather.» What is a drake? | A female duck | A kind of fish | *A male duck | A green bird
test: «A song sounding like the singers Drake and The Weeknd» uses Drake as what? | A stormy sea | *A singer | A sea captain | A duck
exam: In «the wide Drake Passage», the clues are wide and sea, so which meaning fits best? | *A name for a sea place | A dragon in a story | A male duck | A shiny green head
